      "source_location": "line 1",
      "rationale": "Nine PR-sized phases ordered by dependency: the paint reconciler (Phase 2) lands before the work built on its surface (Phases 4, 6), and shared test utilities (Phase 5) land before the gap tests that consume them (Phase 6). Every behavioral change is matrix-pinned by unit tests before hooks are rewired.",
