      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/archive/2026-06-12-review-followups.md",
      "source_location": "Phase 3",
      "rationale": "A latched style flag survived a style reload, leaving paint stale. The fix is written TDD-style with a suite-level e2e assertion that provably fails before the fix, because a latch bug is exactly the kind that a passing-after test cannot distinguish from luck.",
